      "statement": "Agent credentials are no longer environment-only: the agent section reports provider_record, the wizard promotes the verified setup key to a global AgentProvider record (migration 0047_agent_provider_link), links it to the installation selection, and the runtime runs on that encrypted record when no provider credential is in the environment.",
      "limit": "The environment still wins: OPENAI_API_KEY or ANTHROPIC_* shadow the provider record, and a record exists only after the wizard key was verified, so a deferred AI step leaves provider_record false.",
