      "statement": "The operational section writes a backup declaration: apply_section accepts action declare with target, location_kind, schedule, retention and responsible, stores it in installation_backup_policy (migration 0049_setup_backup_policy) and returns status declared with the row read back, so production can clear backup_policy_declared without accept_risk and never reads it as passed.",
